{"seq":1,"slug":"drug-structure","title":"大学药学 — 药物的化学结构与分类","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/medicine/pharmacy/pharmaceutical-chemistry/drug-structure","wordCount":1766,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"大学药学-药物的化学结构与分类\">大学药学 — 药物的化学结构与分类</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>药物分子的化学结构是决定其药理活性、代谢途径和毒性特征的根本因素。理解药物结构不仅需要掌握有机化学的基本概念，还需要将分子层面的信息与宏观的生物效应联系起来。药物化学的核心任务之一，就是通过解析和修饰化学结构来发现更安全、更有效的治疗药物。</p>\n<p>药物结构分析涵盖以下关键领域：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>官能团与药效关系</strong>：羟基 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mtext>OH</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-\\text{OH}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">OH</span></span></span></span></span></span>、氨基 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><msub><mtext>NH</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-\\text{NH}_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">NH</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、羧基 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mtext>COOH</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-\\text{COOH}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">COOH</span></span></span></span></span></span> 等官能团直接影响药物的水溶性、酸碱性和与靶点的结合能力</li>\n<li><strong>立体化学</strong>：手性中心的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R/S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span> 构型、顺反异构等空间排列决定了药物的光学活性和生物选择性</li>\n<li><strong>分子骨架</strong>：苯环、杂环（吡啶、嘧啶、吲哚等）、脂肪链构成药物的基本碳骨架</li>\n<li><strong>理化性质</strong>：分子量、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\log P</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span>（脂水分配系数）、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><msub><mi>K</mi><mi>a</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">pK_a</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 值等参数影响药物的吸收与分布</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"详细讲解\">详细讲解</h2><h3 id=\"一-药物的基本结构单元\">一、药物的基本结构单元</h3><p>药物分子可以分解为若干基本结构单元来理解。最常见的骨架类型包括：</p>\n<p><strong>芳香环体系</strong>：苯环是许多药物的核心骨架。例如，阿司匹林（乙酰水杨酸）的结构可以表示为苯环上连接乙酰氧基和羧基：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Aspirin: </mtext><msub><mtext>C</mtext><mn>6</mn></msub><msub><mtext>H</mtext><mn>4</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mtext>OCOCH</mtext><mn>3</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>COOH</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Aspirin: } \\text{C}_6\\text{H}_4(\\text{OCOCH}_3)(\\text{COOH})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Aspirin: </span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">C</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">6</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">H</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">4</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">OCOCH</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">COOH</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>苯环提供了刚性的平面结构，有利于与蛋白质靶点的疏水口袋结合。</p>\n<p><strong>杂环体系</strong>：含氮、氧、硫等杂原子的环状结构在药物中极为常见。吡啶环 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>C</mtext><mn>5</mn></msub><msub><mtext>H</mtext><mn>5</mn></msub><mtext>N</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{C}_5\\text{H}_5\\text{N}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">C</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">5</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">H</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">5</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">N</span></span></span></span></span></span> 因为氮原子的碱性，可以在生理 pH 下质子化，增强水溶性。嘧啶环则是核酸碱基（胞嘧啶、胸腺嘧啶、尿嘧啶）的骨架，因此嘧啶类药物常用于抗肿瘤治疗。</p>\n<p><strong>脂肪链与环</strong>：饱和碳链和脂肪环提供柔性结构。例如，前列腺素类药物含有 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>C</mtext><mn>20</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{C}_{20}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">C</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">20</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 脂肪酸链，其顺式双键的位置和数量决定了不同亚型的生物活性。</p>\n<h3 id=\"二-官能团对药物性质的影响\">二、官能团对药物性质的影响</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>官能团</th>\n<th>化学特征</th>\n<th>对药物的影响</th>\n<th>代表药物</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>羟基 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mtext>OH</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-\\text{OH}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">OH</span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>氢键供体/受体</td>\n<td>增加水溶性，与靶点形成氢键</td>\n<td>吗啡、肾上腺素</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>氨基 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><msub><mtext>NH</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-\\text{NH}_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">NH</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>碱性，可质子化</td>\n<td>增加水溶性，形成离子键</td>\n<td>氨苄西林、普鲁卡因</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>羧基 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mtext>COOH</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-\\text{COOH}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">COOH</span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>酸性，可去质子化</td>\n<td>形成盐类提高溶解度</td>\n<td>布洛芬、阿司匹林</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>酯基 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mtext>COOR</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-\\text{COOR}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">COOR</span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>可被酯酶水解</td>\n<td>制备前药的常用连接基团</td>\n<td>氯吡格雷、奥司他韦</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>酰胺 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mtext>CONHR</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-\\text{CONHR}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CONHR</span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>氢键供/受体</td>\n<td>代谢稳定性高于酯键</td>\n<td>利多卡因、青霉素</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>卤素 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mtext>F, Cl, Br</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-\\text{F, Cl, Br}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">F, Cl, Br</span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>电负性，疏水</td>\n<td>增强脂溶性，阻断代谢位点</td>\n<td>氟西汀、氯氮平</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"三-立体化学与药物活性\">三、立体化学与药物活性</h3><p>手性是药物化学中的核心概念。许多药物含有手性碳原子，其两种对映异构体可能具有完全不同的生物活性。</p>\n<p>以布洛芬为例，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo>−</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S-(+)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">+</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>-布洛芬是抗炎活性形式，而 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo>−</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R-(-)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>-布洛芬活性较弱。在体内，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span></span>-异构体可以缓慢转化为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span>-异构体。临床上常用消旋体，但纯 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span>-异构体（右布洛芬）起效更快。</p>\n<p>另一个典型案例是沙利度胺（反应停）：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span></span>-构型具有镇静作用，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span>-构型却导致严重致畸。这一惨痛教训推动了手性药物的开发和监管要求。</p>\n<p>立体化学的评价参数包括：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>比旋光度</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>α</mi><msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mi>D</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[\\alpha]_D</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>：衡量光学活性的物理常数</li>\n<li><strong>对映体过量值</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>e</mi><mi>e</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>R</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>−</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>S</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>R</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>S</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mn>100</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">ee = \\frac{|[R]-[S]|}{[R]+[S]} \\times 100\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ee</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.53em;vertical-align:-0.52em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.01em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mopen mtight\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">]</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mopen mtight\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">]</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.485em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">∣</span><span class=\"mopen mtight\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">]</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mopen mtight\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">]</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">∣</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.52em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">100%</span></span></span></span></span></li>\n<li><strong>立体选择性指数</strong>：对不同异构体与靶点结合力的比值</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"四-lipinski-五规则与类药性\">四、Lipinski 五规则与类药性</h3><p>Christopher Lipinski 提出的&quot;五规则&quot;是评估化合物口服吸收潜力的经典标准：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>分子量</mtext><mo>≤</mo><mn>500</mn><mtext> Da</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{分子量} \\leq 500 \\text{ Da}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8193em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">分子量</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">500</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> Da</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>P</mi><mo>≤</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\log P \\leq 5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5</span></span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>氢键供体</mtext><mo>≤</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{氢键供体} \\leq 5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8193em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">氢键供体</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5</span></span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>氢键受体</mtext><mo>≤</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{氢键受体} \\leq 10</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8193em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">氢键受体</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>满足这些条件的化合物通常具有良好的口服生物利用度。但需注意，这并非绝对规则——天然产物类药物（如环孢素 A）和大分子药物常常违反五规则却仍有良好的药动学特性。</p>\n<h3 id=\"五-药物的化学分类体系\">五、药物的化学分类体系</h3><p>按照化学结构骨架，药物可分为以下主要类别：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[药物化学分类] --&gt; B[磺胺类]&#10;    A --&gt; C[β-内酰胺类]&#10;    A --&gt; D[喹诺酮类]&#10;    A --&gt; E[苯并二氮卓类]&#10;    A --&gt; F[甾体类]&#10;    A --&gt; G[生物碱类]&#10;    B --&gt; B1[磺胺嘧啶]&#10;    C --&gt; C1[青霉素/头孢菌素]&#10;    D --&gt; D1[左氧氟沙星]&#10;    E --&gt; E1[地西泮]&#10;    F --&gt; F1[泼尼松/雌二醇]&#10;    G --&gt; G1[吗啡/奎宁]\">graph TD\n    A[药物化学分类] --&gt; B[磺胺类]\n    A --&gt; C[β-内酰胺类]\n    A --&gt; D[喹诺酮类]\n    A --&gt; E[苯并二氮卓类]\n    A --&gt; F[甾体类]\n    A --&gt; G[生物碱类]\n    B --&gt; B1[磺胺嘧啶]\n    C --&gt; C1[青霉素/头孢菌素]\n    D --&gt; D1[左氧氟沙星]\n    E --&gt; E1[地西泮]\n    F --&gt; F1[泼尼松/雌二醇]\n    G --&gt; G1[吗啡/奎宁]</pre><p>每一类药物共享相似的核心骨架，但通过侧链和取代基的变化产生不同的药理特性。这种&quot;同类异构&quot;的思路是药物化学中先导化合物优化的基础。</p>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li><p>绘制对乙酰氨基酚（扑热息痛）的结构式，标出所有官能团，并分析每个官能团对其解热镇痛活性的贡献。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>布洛芬的分子式为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>C</mtext><mn>13</mn></msub><msub><mtext>H</mtext><mn>18</mn></msub><msub><mtext>O</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{C}_{13}\\text{H}_{18}\\text{O}_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">C</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">13</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">H</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">18</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">O</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，计算其分子量，并判断是否符合 Lipinski 五规则的分子量要求。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>解释为什么将阿莫西林结构中的氨基替换为甲氧基后，抗菌活性会显著下降。思考氢键供体能力的变化如何影响与靶蛋白（PBP）的结合。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>查阅资料，比较左旋多巴 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span>-DOPA 和右旋多巴 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span>-DOPA 的药理活性差异，并解释为什么帕金森病治疗只使用 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span>-构型。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>某化合物的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>P</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>6.2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\log P = 6.2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">6.2</span></span></span></span></span>，分子量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>580</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">= 580</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.3669em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">580</span></span></span></span></span>，氢键供体数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">= 2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.3669em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span></span></span>，氢键受体数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">= 8</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.3669em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">8</span></span></span></span></span>。判断其口服吸收的可能性，并提出结构优化建议。</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"拓展阅读\">拓展阅读</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>《药物化学》</strong>（仉文升主编）：国内药学专业经典教材，系统介绍药物结构与活性的关系</li>\n<li><strong>&quot;An Introduction to Medicinal Chemistry&quot; (Graham Patrick)</strong>：英文经典入门读物，以案例驱动讲解药物结构</li>\n<li><strong>DrugBank 数据库</strong> (<a href=\"https://go.drugbank.com)：查询药物结构、靶点、药代动力学参数的在线工具\">https://go.drugbank.com)：查询药物结构、靶点、药代动力学参数的在线工具</a></li>\n<li><strong>PubChem</strong> (<a href=\"https://pubchem.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov)：美国国立卫生研究院维护的化学分子数据库，可搜索三维结构\">https://pubchem.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov)：美国国立卫生研究院维护的化学分子数据库，可搜索三维结构</a></li>\n<li><strong>Lipinski 原始论文</strong>：Lipinski CA et al. &quot;Experimental and computational approaches to estimate solubility and permeability in drug discovery,&quot; <em>Adv Drug Deliv Rev</em>, 1997</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>药物的化学结构是理解其全部药理特性的出发点。通过识别官能团、分析立体化学、评估类药性参数，可以系统地预测一个分子是否具有成为药物的潜力。Lipinski 五规则提供了快速筛选的框架，而深入的构效关系分析则需要结合结构生物学和计算化学手段。掌握药物结构分类方法，有助于在学习后续药理学和临床药学课程时，快速建立不同药物之间的关联。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"大学药学 — 药物的化学结构与分类","id":"大学药学-药物的化学结构与分类"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":2,"text":"详细讲解","id":"详细讲解"},{"level":3,"text":"一、药物的基本结构单元","id":"一-药物的基本结构单元"},{"level":3,"text":"二、官能团对药物性质的影响","id":"二-官能团对药物性质的影响"},{"level":3,"text":"三、立体化学与药物活性","id":"三-立体化学与药物活性"},{"level":3,"text":"四、Lipinski 五规则与类药性","id":"四-lipinski-五规则与类药性"},{"level":3,"text":"五、药物的化学分类体系","id":"五-药物的化学分类体系"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"拓展阅读","id":"拓展阅读"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":null,"next":{"title":"大学药学 — 药物合成方法与策略","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/medicine/pharmacy/pharmaceutical-chemistry/synthetic-methods"}}